					"usage": "Beyond ½D",
					"usage_notes": "Half damage past ½D (the usual GURPS rule) and the armour divisor falls from (10) to (3) as the fusion beam loses cohesion. Still dangerous to light vehicles (avg 63 vs AV10 DR 125/3 = eff. 41, 91% penetration), half the time against AV11 and never against AV13 or a Leman Russ or Land Raider's frontal glacis.\n",
